    {
      "id": "claim_9ee42094397a422e8d73017b004a67e5",
      "statement": "整个网关只维持一条 codex app-server 子进程：server.js 懒建单个 AppServerHost 并传给每个 ThreadRuntime，runtime 的 spawnIfNeeded 在有 host 时不自己 spawn 而是复用 host.start() 返回的同一个 child，因此进程数不随会话数增长。",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://server.js#L1242-L1257",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b2631e0458a281d26f0da7d76bdad0dc32edf3abcb83b7f32e04fe5f7ff7960d:"
